Local changes to the upstream copy:
  - Removed the CDN import map and the remote lil-gui import; dependencies now
    resolve from the locked npm packages (offline build).
  - Added 25 mm hole snapping, table bounds, base collision checks and a
    pointer-based palette drag path in src/upstream/main.js.
  - Added camera view presets and a read-only diagnostics hook
    (window.__beambench) used by tests.
  - Fixed the palette element id so the existing drag/drop handlers attach.

