Publication notes — 2026-10-24

Original author: Hussein-Tofaili; upstream maintainer: VisuPhy.
This is an independently modified derivative, not an official upstream release.
Local modifications include the laboratory environment and optomechanics,
Chinese controls, placement/history/host integration, and the data-only modular
optics-library interface and polarization, geometric-optics and Gaussian-beam
presets. Changes were made on or
before 2026-10-24. Copyright and license notices in the imported sources remain
intact. All local additions are conveyed under GPL-3.0-or-later.

The root LICENSE and the polarization package LICENSE now reproduce the
complete, unmodified GPLv3 text retained from the fixed upstream revision; the
previous shortened root text was not a valid verbatim copy of that license.
Third-party runtime license texts are in THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.txt.
The modular library code in src/library/ and the data presets in
library-packages/ are also covered by the GPL-3.0-or-later declaration above.

Version 1.2.0 adds optional procedural detailed models in src/models/,
detailed-build adapters, front-absorbing detector behavior in that profile,
and the detailed-model UGI shaft connection correction. The original rendering
profile and imported source notices remain intact.
